    "lesson": {
      "kind": "theorem",
      "declaration": "AutoSamplingTheory.ExampleCases.ProximalBPS.ActualProjectedRotation.actual_projected_rotation",
      "title": "Actual PBPS projected reflection rotation and exact pair energy",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06905v1#A2",
          "label": "PBPS2609.06905v1 Appendix B3 B21 A2.Ex15.m2; independent source graph P12/P13/P14 actual projected rotation and pair energy; P16/P17 corrector change and P19 B4 consumers. Mean(g)=0 is an internal completion from actual reflection-law preservation and conditional-expectation integral preservation.",
