        {
          "title": "Derive the actual polar rotation on the full micro space",
          "text": "Linearity of U,R and V0* gives the reflected macro contribution Gamma0 fP minus the reflected micro contribution V0*D fperp. Apply the full-domain intertwining identity to this actual fperp in ker P. This yields the formula for gV=V0*Rg on its actual output semantics.",
          "formula": "g_V=V_0^*RU\\iota f_P-V_0^*D f_\\perp=\\Gamma_0f_P+A_0V_0^*f_\\perp=\\Gamma_0f_P+A_0f_V.",
          "lean": "    have hgVformula : V0.adjoint (R g)=ΓP0 fP+A0 fV := by\n      change V0.adjoint (R (U (P f-(f-P f))))=_\n      rw [hInput,map_sub,map_sub,hRUm,map_sub,hVadjB]\n      have hd := DFunLike.congr_fun hIntertwine fperp\n      change V0.adjoint (D fperp)= -(A0 fV) at hd\n      change ΓP0 fP-V0.adjoint (D fperp)=_\n      rw [hd,sub_neg_eq_add]\n",
          "detail": "Exact compiled BODY span; preceding local definitions and inherited Hilbert structures stay in scope.",
          "lean_source_region": {
            "path": "AutoSamplingTheory/ExampleCases/ProximalBPS/ActualProjectedRotation.lean",
